- K031: LABEL-SIDE FIXES THAT DID NOT MOVE THE GOAL: cross-fitted position detrend (N036, v5cx: split-0 FOV-share gap .055 -> .017 = no-detrend level, residual held-out position signal ~ v5c; trend is real, out-of-fold explains autofl .824 vs in-sample .827) and the retrain on it (N037 ensemble .6537 vs .6527, +.0010 flat; test cells are all split 2 so were never in-sample detrended); per-cell-background labels v8 (N039): mechanism confirmed (CD19 FOV excess .51 -> .00) but pre-registered QC FAILED (draw-1 CD19 has no positive mode; r(v8,v5) CD19 .53/.69, CD14 draw 1 .925), v8 not used [verified] (N036, N037, N039; .agent-research/results/N037-goal-retrain-on-cross-fitted-labels-n031/n037_goal.csv, .agent-research/results/N036-label-position-detrend-v7-cross-fit-the/fov_share.csv) {cites:0}
