### GS chain
- K005: GS<->LF pairs are real: Wright-morphology clusters (DinoBloom k-means) agree with LF-predicted lineage at 0.858 cell level; a PBC-trained classifier collapses on BSCCM Wright cells (72 % "platelet") -> BSCCM GS is far from clinical smears [verified] (N008; N008-external-lineage-anchor-pbc-acevedo-mgg/lineage_anchor.json, gs_cluster_vs_lf.json) {cites:3}
